  "geometry_matching_disclosure": "Pattern-036: the published parent applies ZWARN==0 + SPECTYPE==GALAXY + 0.01<z<2.0 to the zall table; the BGS_BRIGHT clustering randoms trace the BGS_BRIGHT target selection over 0.01<z<0.50 only \u2014 the GALAXY-spectype cut has no randoms analog and dark-program (LRG/ELG) parent galaxies have no BGS randoms. The weighted build is therefore restricted to the 0.01<z<0.50 window (99.3% of matched CW/CCW spirals) and compared against an identically-windowed unweighted control build on the same grid, so the delta isolates the completeness weighting.",
